error[NK2202]: `two` is `sync`, but it contains an `async` form, which can pause.
  --> tests/async_form_in_a_sync_function_is_nk2202.nika:3:13
   |
 3 |     let a = async one()
   |             ^^^^^ this can pause
   |
   = note: A `sync` function promises that it never pauses and does no I/O.
   = note: An `async` form waits for the tasks it starts, which is a pause.
   = help: Remove `sync` from `two`, or move the call out of it.
1 call a `sync` function may not make
